==Czech==
{{wp|lang=cs}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|cs|zlw-ocs|ucho}}, from {{inh|cs|sla-pro|*uxo}}, from {{der|cs|ine-pro|*h₂ous-}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|cs|/ˈuxo/}}
* {{audio|cs|Cs-ucho.ogg|audio}}

===Noun===
{{cs-noun|g=n}}

# [[ear]]
# [[handle]] {{gloss|of a pot}}
# [[eye]] {{gloss|hole at the blunt end of a needle}}

====Usage notes====
The dual form is used when talking about human or animal ears, no matter their number (e. g. ''čtyři králičí uši'' = four rabbit ears), while the plural is used when referring to various ear-shaped objects (''ucha hrnce'' = handles of a pot).

